{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2023-10", "window": 4, "start_date": 1698105600, "end_date": 1698796799, "month_true_total": 67, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:59:06 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "149250591", "author": {"steamid": "76561198086299625", "personaname": "Firewolf", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/firewolfdaimyo/", "num_games_owned": 256, "num_reviews": 87, "playtime_forever": 961, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 961, "last_played": 1686319985, "avatar": "eb422a01b2033244bd81f25f2cbb42054ff1a167"}, "language": "english", "review": "I couldn't enjoy this game no matter how much I tried to. I absolutely love the original ME series, but this just seems to take my least favourite game play mechanics from them and make it into the main event. It reminds me of DA:I where its all about roaming around empty worlds for 10 minutes to do various time sink activities. It certainly had some highlights, I like the new characters and the ship designs, but honestly can't bring myself to open this game again knowing I have another 10 minutes to drive in a boring snowy tundra to get to an objective I have already done 3 times before.", "timestamp_created": 1698758645, "timestamp_updated": 1698758645, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 54, "votes_funny": 6, "weighted_vote_score": "0.731008648872375488", "comment_count": 3, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 7, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "149214377", "author": {"steamid": "76561198067435942", "personaname": "Telion Fondrad", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/coshe/", "num_games_owned": 341, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 13, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13, "deck_playtime_at_review": 13, "last_played": 1698694824, "avatar": "b6a14c83d563fc1eaac2ff9d1c5badb397c158d2"}, "language": "english", "review": "Couldn't launch this on steamdeck. Couldn't get past \"Something wen't wrong\" error in EA launcher. I tried launching it with Proton Experimental but no luck, it seems to be broken because of that trash launcher they added.", "timestamp_created": 1698697296, "timestamp_updated": 1698697296, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.454545468091964722", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "149171023", "author": {"steamid": "76561198190699538", "personaname": "Adam Bah Dukun", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ledododo/", "num_games_owned": 73, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 4770, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4511, "last_played": 1699445215, "avatar": "846605b616bdd2453d92eb3999b0d6d858c3c26c"}, "language": "english", "review": "From a Commander to Pathfinder or Errand Boy who goes planet to planet back to back doing a go and fetch quest while watching unskippable cutscene.\n\nThe change to open world make it more difficult to get hooked into the plot or the characters like the trilogy because you will drowned into a hundred of sidequests (unless you are ignoring them).\nBut the main-planets are beautifully crafted so at least you can enjoy the view while driving across the map.\n\nThe changes to not sharing abilities cooldown, combo priming, and dashing resulting in more fluid combat and it is an improvement but also it makes things easier, which also in my opinion, makes insanity more fun because more builds are viable.\n\nIf you haven't play the trilogy then play it first. If you are combat first story later guy then you will enjoy Andromeda", "timestamp_created": 1698634432, "timestamp_updated": 1698634432, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "149154313", "author": {"steamid": "76561199204216113", "personaname": "DanicaNight", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199204216113/", "num_games_owned": 431, "num_reviews": 159, "playtime_forever": 10505, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9953, "last_played": 1699069004, "avatar": "be458d103d784091f3d1e6eb6933eb6986a6af80"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun exploring", "timestamp_created": 1698611690, "timestamp_updated": 1698611690, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "149097156", "author": {"steamid": "76561199213265343", "personaname": "chickenman", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/trashcan1_/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 3315, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3315, "last_played": 1698550770, "avatar": "c687decd23d828679fd95f4fd027c26d7c0304b7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun space exploration game!\nBuy this during a sale though, it's a fun game, but it's nothing amazing.", "timestamp_created": 1698550921, "timestamp_updated": 1698550921, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "receiv